   {
    "text": "Rooted in history and rich with charm, The Homestead carries stories that span generations. More than a hundred years ago, Blackie Wilshire and his spirited family made this glen their home. Today, pieces of that original homestead still stand thoughtfully woven into the experience we offer, where e",
    "years": [],
