   },
   {
    "text": "\"Everything was perfect and the team they have there at the HomeStead are so supportive and friendly and they made the day something I couldn't have even begun to dream about. If you're thinking about booking here, seriously take a tour and see everything they have to offer it took me less than 5 mi",
    "years": [],
    "source": "https://homesteadoakglen.com/about"
