   {
    "text": "Here at The HomeStead we make every effort to make your wedding planning and event a true success. We've worked hard to preserve the original feel of the family ranch, while adding a few modern amenities so that you feel at home and fully satisfied in your special day - a day that we hope you'll be ",
    "years": [],
    "source": "https://homesteadoakglen.com/about"
   },
   {
    "text": "Tucked away on 5.5 scenic acres in Oak Glen, The Homestead at Wilshire Ranch is surrounded by the beauty of Wilshire Peak and the San Bernardino Mountains. Towering oaks, sweeping sycamores, heirloom apple trees, and a blooming lilac field bring natural elegance to the grounds. Overlooking the quiet",
